Roles and Responsibilities
Role	Responsibilities
Admin	Manage users, products, categories, suppliers, inventory, and system settings
Inventory Manager	Add/update products, monitor stock, manage stock-in/stock-out, generate inventory reports
Sales Staff	Create sales/orders, check product availability, update sold quantities
Purchase Manager	Manage suppliers, create purchase orders, record incoming stock
Warehouse Staff	Receive products, update stock quantities, manage warehouse operations
Viewer	View products, stock levels, and reports without modifying data

